# What @fullstacked/p2p ships, for `npm publish` and for installs straight from GitHub
# (npm and the FullStacked installer both trim a git dependency with this file):
# the client driver (TypeScript sources for FullStacked bundles, dist/index.js for Node.js) and
# its README. The Server ships as the Docker image fullstackedorg/p2p.
/*
!/package.json
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/src
!/dist
/src/server
